※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4686 LANG_CLOSED_BY_INVALID

※ What `@[closed_by(f)]` names is a function `T.f` of the type's own file that
※ takes one `T` by value.

@[closed_by(release)]
type Handle = n : u8

fn Handle.release(h: &Handle):
    let n: u8 = h⌖.n

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    0u6
